  "releaseNotes": "Fix (Martin Honnen): xsl:for-each-group with group-by — an item whose group-by expression atomizes to the empty sequence now contributes no grouping key and joins no group (previously the engine formed a single group with an empty grouping key). Streaming: a consuming expression placed inside surrounding constructed output now streams in place rather than dropping the wrapper or iterating empty — covers a consuming xsl:for-each / xsl:apply-templates wrapped in literal result elements or xsl:if/xsl:choose, and per-item consuming operators and functions in a simple-map (treat/instance-of, union/except/intersect, sequence, square-array, head/tail/remove/subsequence over a streamed path). Requires PhoenixmlDb.Core 1.1.9 and PhoenixmlDb.XQuery 1.4.6. See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
